盲治疗8周；安全随访2周。","quote_sha256":"9bd5fd21a15316c3c80d6126372a72eccba8ebc6cda070fd09f4c7804cff1c7a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"治疗政策策略：主要终点为第8周24h平均NRS自基线变化；急救对乙酰氨基酚不改变归属；脱落不替换按ITT入FAS。","quote_sha256":"30e99fdc225a2c7a125e968b39bdadb8557e08f76ebfd1b6cb52b16facbd7949","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"访视策略：筛选、基线、第2/4/8周、安全随访；电子疼痛日记每日NRS记录。","quote_sha256":"bebbc02600c20a056fa50c49f78b2590eff65c72150fac1c48f586cfaf64f4a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_005"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_002","es_003","es_004","es_005"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充项目级急救用药方案或参考已批准PHN方案中的急救用药条款","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_sec6_rescue_dose","missing_source_classes":["项目急救用药方案","已批准PHN方案参考"],"target":"急救对乙酰氨基酚具体剂量、最大日剂量及使用条件"},{"action":"由医学经理与制剂团队确认双模拟操作细节","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_sec6_blind_detail","missing_source_classes":["双盲双模拟操作方案","制剂规格文件"],"target":"双盲双模拟各组具体操作方案（各组是否同时服用模拟剂及模拟剂规格）"}],"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照加活性对照的II期临床研究，采用平行组设计，按1:1:1比例将受试者随机分配至以下三个治疗组：KZ-PHN902 100mg每日两次口服组、KZ-PHN902 200mg每日两次口服组、普瑞巴林活性对照组。双盲治疗期共8周，采用双盲双模拟方法维持盲态。研究时期包括筛选期2周、双盲治疗期8周及安全随访期2周。主要疗效终点为第8周24小时平均疼痛NRS评分较基线的变化，采用治疗政策策略进行分析；急救用药对乙酰氨基酚的使用不改变受试者的治疗组归属，脱落受试者不进行替换，按意向性分析原则纳入全分析集。安全性评估涵盖不良事件（重点关注头晕、嗜睡、步态异常）、生命体征、心电图及实验室检查。访视安排为筛选、基线、第2周、第4周、第8周及安全随访访视，治疗期间受试者通过电子疼痛日记每日记录NRS评分。","rationale":"本章正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体研究设计、分配模型、研究时期、访视策略、估计目标策略及安全性终点模块撰写。双盲双模拟的具体操作细节（如各组是否同时服用模拟剂）及急救对乙酰氨基酚的具体剂量与使用条件需医学经理进一步确认。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_ba53d4d2f2ebfcff","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:1d17fc3b1beda415288db82f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006152829_51c9e36c","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"试验药物：KZ-PHN902（口服Nav1.7通道选择性阻滞剂片）","quote_sha256":"1f71950d3b663a18c39184b74c310785c5c93aa9bcf3ddd53f3932a6547d9984","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d633